        <action priority="80">HandAttack</action><attacktype>LogicalTypeRangedUnitsAttack</attacktype><autoattacktype>LogicalTypeRangedUnitsAutoAttack</autoattacktype><attackresponsetype>LogicalTypeRangedUnitsAttack</attackresponsetype><attackmovetype>AbstractWall</attackmovetype></tactic>
